            "0": "Of course. <CUSTOM101> \n\nI have been studying the signs and have uncovered the name of our enemy, it is no other than <CUSTOM100>. \n\nThis will not be an easy challenge to overcome, and perhaps you are not yet ready to take on this task.  \n\nAre you ready? "
